From 335f966994a36db92aa89df09ad4701757f110ae Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: The browser Authors <noreply@browser.invalid>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 17:38:35 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 14/61] agent-snapshot

CDP Page.captureAgentSnapshot / Page.resolveAgentNode: cross-frame
interactive-element perception with root-viewport geometry, plus the
blink agent_snapshot collector module. Also carries the cursor-overlay
wiring in page_handler.cc/.h.

Riders: the settle (agentSettleArm/agentSettle, AgentSettleWatcher, loader interaction-origin hooks), id space, deltas, layers, live regions, hit check, frozen-frame redaction (holdForSecrets, agentFinishCapture), agentNavigateToHistoryEntry; page_handler.* and Page.pdl also carry the frame-stream commands and the Input action-outcome types; and video-recording's Page.agentMarkSecretField, which marks an element as holding a secret for a redacted recording: its handler in page_handler.*, the command in Page.pdl and on Blink's Page exclude list (inspector_protocol_config.json), and MarkSecretField and MarkFocusedField in agent_snapshot_collector.mojom and agent_snapshot_collector_impl.*. agent_card_fields.cc now calls the card field rule in core/paint/agent_redaction/agent_field_rules, which redacted recordings share, and GetCdpCursorOverlay leaves out the overlay a video recording makes that does not draw on the window.
