+  # slot size in bytes (uint64), latest (uint64: sequence << 2 | slot), then
+  # per slot at 32 + 32 * i: sequence (uint64, odd while being written),
+  # width, height, stride (uint32 each), reserved (uint32), capture time in
+  # microseconds since the Unix epoch (int64). The event is signalled after
