+// browser: Page.agentNodesAlive's renderer half: per id, alive when its
+// element is connected and under this local root (OwnedElement), rendered
+// when it has a LayoutObject as of the last layout, what it reads now and,
+// for a form field, its validity. No layout, no accessibility tree, no page
+// script (a pattern is matched as user-agent script).
+void AgentSnapshotCollectorImpl::NodesAlive(const Vector<int32_t>& node_ids,
+                                            NodesAliveCallback callback) {
